<title>USA: Hayes Wheels gets two Ford contracts.</title>
<headline>Hayes Wheels gets two Ford contracts.</headline>
<dateline>ROMULUS, Mich. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayes Wheels International Inc said Tuesday it received two contracts from Ford Motor Co to supply chromed steel wheels for two of its sport-utility vehicles beginning with the 1997 model year.</p>
<p>Hayes said it will provide wheels for the Ford Expedition and Mercury Montaineer vehicles.</p>
<p>The wheels are being produced at the company's facilities in Sedalia, Missouri. Shipments began earlier this autumn, Hayes said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
